ed repair boundary. The existing graph requires further drafting: export complete time-window support/regularity facts from N001, revise R004 to use N001 and the recovered bilinear integration-by-parts theorem with its integrability/Frechet derivative hypotheses proved, repair empty support domination, define the Euclidean Borel/Lebesgue ambient and compact-measure fact with probed sources, and establish zero-integral in R001. No unsupported mathematical implication has been judged to be a substantive gap; this is ordinary unfinished source registration and graph drafting. I have not submitted an artifact or claimed a check/Audit A acceptance.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"The frozen task inputs and prior-candidate statements, Audit A findings, and recovered-library-source.json; checked M011 query evidence and Mathlib/Analysis/Calculus/LineDeriv/IntegrationByParts.lean lines 1–100.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Read SKILL.md, nl0-stage.md, nl0-format.md, self-containment.md, nl0-authoring.md; read audit-findings.json, frozen-target.md, problem.md, source-context.md, recovered-library-source.json and prior-candidate.json. Verified M011 declaration signature, source hash, commit, theorem kind and axioms via probe_library; read official source documentation and hypotheses setup. Still need finish patch, probe/register compact measure facts and any other replacement source, structurally check, then submit the revised graph for fresh scoped Audit A.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report exact status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP or SUSPECTED_GAP stops for an actual unsupported mathematical implication; give its premises, conclusion and mathematical grounds. SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT stops for a real source-access/original-input obstacle. Ordinary unfinished drafting, source registration or format work must use TASK_INCOMPLETE: this records progress without ending the stage; 